# Your sources in raw/ are committed, so every clone and every cloud
# session has them. Keep this repository private: they hold customer and
# company facts.
# To keep sources on one computer instead, add these three lines:
#   raw/*
#   !raw/README.md
#   !raw/public/
#   !raw/playbook/

# Book files are copyrighted. They stay on your computer.
raw/books/

.DS_Store
.obsidian/workspace*.json

# Daily briefs can hold email text, so they are never committed. The
# brief's settings are kept.
daily/*
!daily/settings.md
__pycache__/
